    "updated_at": "2017-03-20T10:01:02Z",
    "body": "Thank you both for replies and explanations.\r\n\r\nBased on what you say, it sounds to me like the entrance counter is probably unnecessary, and that the top-most realm execution context on the stack would be the right one to use regardless.",
